# Local configuration and anything that could hold personal health data. Extensions match in any case, as a
# case-sensitive disk (Linux) tells REPORT.PDF from report.pdf.
# The archive itself lives outside this repository; these are a second line of defense.
.env
.env.*
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]3
*.[dD][bB]
*.[dD][bB]-[wW][aA][lL]
*.[dD][bB]-[sS][hH][mM]
/data
/archive
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]-*
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]3-*
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE].*
*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]3.*
# Backups, encrypted or not, and anything else the archive folder holds.
